  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 11.04pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(260.64pt, 463.08pt, "/h) demanded from the 28 February 2021 to 20 August 2022, ")
  #line-at(36pt, 488.4pt, "measured every 15 minutes. The measurements come from an electromagnetic flowmeter installed at the ")
  #line-at(36pt, 513.72pt, "inlet of the water distribution system of the town. The technical specification of the flowmeter is displayed in ")
  #line-at(36pt, 539.04pt, "table 2. It can be seen how in July and August the flow supplied increases up to 130 m")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 6.96pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(460.32pt, 535.08pt, "3")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 11.04pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(464.16pt, 539.04pt, "/h. However, during ")
  #line-at(36pt, 564.36pt, "the month of March the maximum flow is 20 m")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 6.96pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(267.6pt, 560.4pt, "3")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 11.04pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(271.44pt, 564.36pt, "/h. Between the first and second quarter of the year 2022, ")
  #line-at(36pt, 589.56pt, "there is also an increase in water supplied due to the Easter week, a holiday period in Spain. ")
