  #line-at(36pt, 437.28pt, "significantly increases. During the day, at peak demand times, as the flow rate increases, the pressure P3 ")
  #line-at(36pt, 462.6pt, "decreases, which requires regulation at P2 to maintain a minimum service pressure. These pressure patterns ")
  #line-at(36pt, 487.92pt, "are known by the experience of the water operator and can be used to determine if there are leaks in the ")
