  #line-at(36pt, 527.52pt, "can be used to identify periodicities [40]. The delays represented in the graphs (ACF) and (PACF) can take ")
  #line-at(36pt, 552.72pt, "values that can range between ±1, with the delays that present values close to these levels being those that ")
