  #line-at(36pt, 729.84pt, "tionarity of the series of values considered is confirmed [48]. ")
  #line-at(57.24pt, 755.16pt, "To obtain the best model from all possible models, applying the AIC (Akaike Information Criterion) to ")
  #line-at(36pt, 780.48pt, "discern the best model. The selection criterion penalizes complex models, seeking a balance between the fit ")
