#original-page(595.32pt, 841.92pt, none)[
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 9.96pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(292.68pt, 808.32pt, "23 ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 11.04pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(57.24pt, 90.48pt, "Table 7 shows the anova study carried out on the data for the Easter week period. At a significance level ")
  #line-at(36pt, 115.68pt, "of 95%, the probability value shows a value equal to 0.73 and the null hypothesis of the study cannot be ")
  #line-at(36pt, 141pt, "rejected, so there are no differences between the mean values of the predicted and actual P3 data series. ")
  #line-at(57.24pt, 166.32pt, "The P3 critical point pressure information provided by the ARMAX model can be extremely useful for the ")
  #line-at(36pt, 191.64pt, "management of water distribution networks. Unexpected variations in pressure at the P3 critical point can ")
  #line-at(36pt, 216.96pt, "indicate the presence of leaks, abnormal consupmtion or other anomalies in the network. Furthermore, the ")
  #line-at(36pt, 242.28pt, "implementation of a continuous feedback system has the potential to substantially augment the predictive ")
  #line-at(36pt, 267.48pt, "capacity and adaptability of the ARMAX model. By periodically updating the model with real-time or scheduled ")
  #line-at(36pt, 292.8pt, "data from the network, the system can recalibrate its parameters in real time, thereby ensuring its reliability ")
  #line-at(36pt, 318.12pt, "and accuracy when facing seasonal variations or unanticipated changes in operational conditions. This ")
  #line-at(36pt, 343.44pt, "approach is consistent with best practices in resource management, facilitating the early detection of leaks ")
  #line-at(36pt, 368.76pt, "and the optimisation of pressure control strategies over time. By continuously monitoring the pressure at P3 ")
  #line-at(36pt, 393.96pt, "using the ARMAX model, operators can detect such variations early and take preventive action to repair leaks ")
  #line-at(36pt, 419.28pt, "or other problems before they develop into more serious situations. Another important aspect is that ")
  #line-at(36pt, 444.6pt, "maintaining the pressure in the network within optimal ranges is crucial to ensure efficiente and reliable supply ")
  #line-at(36pt, 469.92pt, "of drinking water. Using the pressure forecasts in P3 provided by the ARMAX model, operators can adjust ")
  #line-at(36pt, 495.24pt, "the settings of pressure control valves and other regulators to optimise pressure throughout the network. This ")
  #line-at(36pt, 520.56pt, "not only helps reduce the risk of leaks and infrastructure damage due to excessive pressure, but also ")
  #line-at(36pt, 545.76pt, "improves the overall operational efficiency of the system. By analysing historical and real-time P3 pressure ")
  #line-at(36pt, 571.08pt, "data provided by the ARMAX model, operators can identify trends and patterns of behaviour that indicate the ")
  #line-at(36pt, 596.4pt, "need for preventive maintenance in specific areas of the network. This allows them to schedule maintenance ")
  #line-at(36pt, 621.72pt, "more effectively and proactively, reducing the risk of unexpected failures and minimising system downtime. ")
  #line-at(57.24pt, 647.04pt, "The successful implementation of the ARMAX model is contingent upon the availability of high-quality ")
  #line-at(36pt, 672.24pt, "data. Inconsistent, incomplete, or noisy datasets can introduce significant challenges, affecting the model's ")
  #line-at(36pt, 697.56pt, "ability to make accurate predictions. Ensuring data quality necessitates the establishment of robust data ")
  #line-at(36pt, 722.88pt, "collection systems and the regular maintenance of sensors and logging equipment. ")
  #line-at(57.24pt, 748.2pt, "Furthermore, adapting the model to different contexts poses additional challenges. Variations in network ")
  #line-at(36pt, 773.52pt, "configurations, demand patterns, and operational conditions may require recalibration or the inclusion of ")
]

